{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — FAQ Accordion Section
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div class="zvhc-section-header">
      <div class="zvhc-eyebrow">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-heading-md">Everything You Need To Know</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-muted); margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Have questions about our sourcing, formula, or our 60-day empty bottle guarantee? We have answers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zvhc-faq-list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item is-open">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">How soon can I expect to see visible hair growth and thickness?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Most customers notice a dramatic reduction in shedding and significantly softer, shinier strands within the first 7–10 days. By weeks 3–4, you will typically observe tiny new baby hairs emerging along edges and thinning areas. For maximum follicle restoration and density, we recommend completing the full 60 to 90-day cycle.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">What makes Honduran Batana Oil so uniquely powerful?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Unlike mineral oil or watered-down silicones that merely coat the hair shaft, 100% raw Honduran Batana contains rare phytosterols and high concentrations of oleic and linoleic essential fatty acids. These lipids closely match the natural sebum produced by human skin, enabling deep cellular penetration into the hair bulb.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">Will this oil weigh down fine or straight hair?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Not at all! While Batana is deeply restorative, it absorbs surprisingly fast. If you have fine or straight hair, simply use 2–3 drops as a pre-wash treatment 30 minutes before shampooing, or massage into your scalp overnight and wash out in the morning.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">Is it safe for color-treated, bleached, or relaxed hair?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Yes, 100%. Chemical processing, bleach, and heat styling strip the hair of its protective lipid membrane. Batana oil replenishes this exact lipid barrier, sealing the cuticle to lock in color pigments and prevent premature fading.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">How does your 60-Day Empty-Bottle Guarantee work?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          We want you to try Zavelyn with complete peace of mind. Use our Batana oil consistently for up to 60 days. If you are not completely delighted with your results, even if you finish every last drop in the bottle, simply email our Dallas support team at support@tryzavelyn.com for a swift, full refund.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
